    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d148-a38">

                <pb facs="0432" n="314" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg314"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure E 11.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mulinuu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-04-01">April, 1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your letter of 10th of April) received by me at about sunset.</p>
                <p>As you know, on the assembly of my Parliament many men have to be present. I
                    cannot help that a greater number should assemble than at other times.</p>
                <p>Do you want to drive me off Mulinuu? If so, tell me and I will go, and my
                    Government, but shall set it up in another place.</p>
                <p>I deny any sort of disrespect to the German Government.</p>
                <p>It is the custom of Samoa to assemble as they are doing. All my people are quiet
                    and without arms, and will not do anything wrong.</p>
                <p>I cannot imagine how you or the captain of the man-of-war can find fault with me
                    or my people on account of my people carrying out their custom, and coming to
                    see me as is usual.</p>
                <p>I would ask you to reconsider your command, for if you persist in it, I must move
                    from the point, but I give you notice that the seat of government will only be
                    moved, and my Government will continue its office.</p>
                <p>If you should be so unnecessarily severe as to order me from the point, I would
                    respectfully ask you whether your prohibition extends to the whole of the
                    municipality.</p>
                <p>May you live.</p>
                <p>I am,</p>
                <closer><signed>MALIETOA,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">King of
                    Samoa.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Dr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuebel</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Imperial German Consul, Matafele.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
